{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Kinetic energy is the energy stored by an object because it is moving. The equation is kinetic energy equals one half multiplied by mass multiplied by speed squared. In symbols, E sub k equals one half m v squared. The mass must be in kilograms, the speed in metres per second and the energy in joules. In this equation, v represents speed, although you may hear it called velocity in some explanations.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": false}", "duration": 27.192, "words": [["Kinetic", 0.102083], ["energy", 0.635958], ["is", 1.13075], ["the", 1.273958], ["energy", 1.44325], ["stored", 1.846875], ["by", 2.198458], ["an", 2.341666], ["object", 2.497916], ["because", 2.901583], ["it", 3.253125], ["is", 3.409375], ["moving.", 3.565625], ["The", 4.84375], ["equation", 5.039083], ["is", 5.481791], ["kinetic", 5.651041], ["energy", 6.132833], ["equals", 6.575541], ["one", 6.992208], ["half", 7.213541], ["multiplied", 7.487], ["by", 8.085958], ["mass", 8.216166], ["multiplied", 8.502625], ["by", 9.088541], ["speed", 9.244791], ["squared.", 9.505208], ["In", 10.9245], ["symbols,", 11.09375], ["E", 11.875], ["sub", 11.979166], ["k", 12.265625], ["equals", 12.473958], ["one", 12.877625], ["half", 13.072916], ["m", 13.346375], ["v", 13.515625], ["squared.", 13.645833], ["The", 15.091166], ["mass", 15.286458], ["must", 15.572916], ["be", 15.820333], ["in", 15.9375], ["kilograms,", 16.09375], ["the", 17.005208], ["speed", 17.148458], ["in", 17.408875], ["metres", 17.552083], ["per", 17.96875], ["second", 18.072916], ["and", 18.450541], ["the", 18.619791], ["energy", 18.684916], ["in", 19.101583], ["joules.", 19.257833], ["In", 20.716166], ["this", 20.9375], ["equation,", 21.106791], ["v", 21.888041], ["represents", 22.03125], ["speed,", 22.565125], ["although", 23.190125], ["you", 23.476583], ["may", 23.606791], ["hear", 23.776041], ["it", 24.010416], ["called", 24.20575], ["velocity", 24.453125], ["in", 25.039083], ["som